WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:01.630
Hello, accountants!

00:00:01.978 --> 00:00:05.150
This lesson shows how to work right inside a client's company:

00:00:05.416 --> 00:00:09.465
check each receipt against the original photo, book quickly with the keyboard,

00:00:09.415 --> 00:00:11.310
ask the client right on the receipt,

00:00:11.643 --> 00:00:14.430
and set up account numbers for each country's chart of accounts.

00:00:14.939 --> 00:00:16.749
In the client list, click Open.

00:00:17.028 --> 00:00:19.469
You enter the client's company with accountant rights:

00:00:19.684 --> 00:00:23.068
the bar at the top says Accountant view, with the client's name.

00:00:23.577 --> 00:00:26.166
Every screen looks just like the business owner's,

00:00:26.116 --> 00:00:28.349
and amounts show in each client's currency.

00:00:28.698 --> 00:00:30.509
Click Back to all clients to return.

00:00:31.146 --> 00:00:34.045
Open Receipts, then click Book one by one.

00:00:34.363 --> 00:00:37.405
Tositeo opens each waiting receipt, in order.

00:00:37.915 --> 00:00:40.763
The original photo sits right next to the booking details.

00:00:40.872 --> 00:00:43.979
Check the date and the merchant, then choose the expense type,

00:00:43.929 --> 00:00:45.163
with its account number.

00:00:45.592 --> 00:00:49.643
The VAT lines section shows the VAT rate, the total and the VAT amount.

00:00:49.914 --> 00:00:53.963
For a receipt with two VAT rates, click Split into another VAT line.

00:00:54.381 --> 00:00:57.003
When you're done, click Book and open next.

00:00:57.191 --> 00:00:58.123
Or just press Enter.

00:00:58.714 --> 00:01:01.082
Keyboard shortcuts make it really fast:

00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:06.013
the left and right arrows move between receipts, R writes a return reason,

00:01:05.963 --> 00:01:07.562
and S splits a VAT line.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:12.042
If a receipt isn't right, write the reason, and click Return to the client.

00:01:12.482 --> 00:01:14.682
To ask something, write in Messages:

00:01:15.003 --> 00:01:18.122
the client gets an e-mail, and answers right on that receipt.

00:01:18.728 --> 00:01:23.009
Under Expense types, you set the account number and the default VAT for each type,

00:01:22.959 --> 00:01:25.898
following the chart of accounts of the client's country.

00:01:26.314 --> 00:01:29.658
From then on, every new receipt comes with a booking suggestion.

00:01:30.128 --> 00:01:34.138
If the client tracks projects or branches, add cost centres below.

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:36.397
Is a client missing receipts?

00:01:36.547 --> 00:01:38.557
In the client list, click Remind.

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:41.508
Tositeo e-mails the client the payments still missing,

00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:43.357
so you don't have to call each person.

00:01:43.705 --> 00:01:44.957
Now take the quiz below.
